caption Earlier that morning...

narrator: <phone rings> <bottles crash>

Harlow: (cough) Federal Monkey Patrol. Harlow here.

Chief: Harlow, this is the Chief of Police! We have a situation. Get to City Hall, now!

Harlow: I deal with monkeys, Chief. Just monkeys. There's not a monkey for miles!
